      149.85,
      367.45,
      437.84,
      378.52
    ],
    "text": "THE FISHERIES AND AQUATIC RESOURCES ACT, No. 2 OF 1996",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      393.13,
      539.87,
      416.2
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the Minister of Home Affairs and Fisheries under Section 61(1)(h) of the Fisheries and AquaticResources Act, No.2 of 1996.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      342.09,
      441.13,
      500.25,
      464.2
    ],
    "text": "JOSEPH MICHAEL PERERA ,Minister of Home Affairs and Fisheries.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      477.13,
      128.25,
      500.2
    ],
    "text": "Colombo .28th February, 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      268.65,
      520.33,
      318.81,
      531.4
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      86.73,
      544.33,
      460.45,
      555.4
    ],
    "text": "1.These regulations may be cited as the Fishing Gear Marking Regulations No. 1 of 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      568.33,
      539.93,
      603.4
    ],
    "text": "2. Every owner or operator of a fishing boat shall mark all fishing gear including all types of gill nets, surroundingnets, fish aggregating devices, fish traps, Ja kotu and all types of long lines carried on such boat as specified in the scheduleI hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      86.73,
      616.33,
      504.6,
      639.4
    ],
    "text": "3.(a) The fishing gear shall be marked by using a tag or flag and shall be displayed prominently and such marking shall be permanent.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      107.85,
      652.33,
      538.25,
      687.4
    ],
    "text": "(b) Every flag, utilized for marking shall not be less than Twenty Five centimeters in height and ThirtyFive centimeters in width; when two flags are required for marking, the distance between them shall notbe less than ten centimeters and every flag shall be made of waterproof material in fluorescent colours;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      750.18,
      92.97,
      760.14
    ],
    "text": "3 - PG 2386",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      71.05,
      528.18,
      92.25
    ],
    "text": "2AI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s\u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2015'03'03PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 03.03.2015",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      107.05,
      547.23,
      130.12
    ],
    "text": "4.Every tag used for marking shall be durable with required water proofing and be able to stay attached to thefishing gear in all sea conditions.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      143.05,
      547.21,
      178.12
    ],
    "text": "5. The markings on the fishing gear shall be in white colour on a black background or in black colour on a whitebackground in an easily readable or identifiable manner by separate letters in one of the official languages depending on theuse of the language in the location and in English Language.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      191.05,
      547.17,
      214.12
    ],
    "text": "6.The markings shall be designed and placed in such a manner in order to prevent interference with theoperation and performance of the fishing gear.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      227.05,
      547.36,
      262.12
    ],
    "text": "7.Any boat call sign name of the boat, harbour in which the boat is registered, registration number of the boatissued by the Department of Fisheries, the name of the owner and the operator of the boat shall be marked in the flag or tagattached to the fishing gear.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      94.27,
      275.05,
      547.17,
      286.12
    ],
    "text": "8.The code mentioned for the relevant fishing gear in the Schedule II hereto shall be marked in the flag or tag.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      94.27,
      299.05,
      314.63,
      310.12
    ],
    "text": "9(1) The fishing gear shall be marked as follows :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      142.99,
      323.05,
      547.23,
      346.12
    ],
    "text": "(i)Every tag used for marking shall be four inches in height and six inches in width and all the detailsspecified in regulation 7 shall be printed or embossed on both sides of it;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      140.59,
      359.05,
      547.15,
      382.12
    ],
    "text": "(ii)every tag or flag shall be printed using florescent colour in black colour on white background orin white colour on black background.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      122.59,
      395.05,
      547.32,
      418.12
    ],
    "text": "(2) Subject to regulation 5 every tag or flag shall be painted using florescent colour and shall be firmlyfixed to fishing gear.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      431.05,
      547.23,
      454.12
    ],
    "text": "10.The owner or Master of any fishing boat shall inform the Director General of the Fisheries Department withimmediate effect of every abandonment or loss of fishing gear.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      467.05,
      547.2,
      490.12
    ],
    "text": "11.Every effort shall be made by the crew, owner or operator to retrieve lost or abandoned gear, particularly ifthe gear -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.539392471313477,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      117.31,
      503.05,
      416.88,
      562.12
    ],
    "text": "(a)presents a hazard to the navigation of surface and sub-surface boats(b)fouls reefs;(c)fouls spawning beds;(d)becomes an impediment to fishing; or(e)continues to ghost fish",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      94.27,
      575.05,
      361.89,
      586.12
    ],
    "text": "12.In these regulations unless the context otherwise requires \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      121.15,
      599.05,
      515.78,
      610.12
    ],
    "text": "\u201cfouls reef\u201d means the damages caused to coral reefs by broken or abandoned fishing gear at sea;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      623.05,
      547.21,
      646.12
    ],
    "text": "\u201cfouls spawning beds\u201d means the damage caused to fish breeding grounds by broken or abandoned fishinggear at sea;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      121.15,
      659.05,
      482.65,
      670.12
    ],
    "text": "\u201cghost fishing\u201d means continuous fish catch by broken or abandoned fishing gear at sea.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      64.89,
      71.05,
      537.93,
